# Routine "Wake on app event": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Webhook wake when the household app POSTs on week_locked, needs_work, or check_now (and similar). Required install step for every household — not optional. This is the only automatic wake path — not a poll.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/bot-my-meals && pi -p "/wake-on-app-event"
